# wip367: FUNC (black key 11) + EDIT tapped alone = DELETE AUTOMATION? (the selected track's recorded knob motion / p-locks
# in the playing pattern). OCT+ deletes, OCT- keeps. Holding EDIT and using ACCENT / FILL / PLAY (page copy / paste / reset) is NOT a delete.
wait 300
tapkey w0
tap FX
wait 100
key w0 down
spin K1 40
wait 200
key w0 up
wait 200
expect lanes 1
# FUNC + EDIT with a page copy in between: no question, the lane stays
key b10 down
press EDIT
tapkey b8
release EDIT
key b10 up
wait 200
expect autoask 0
expect lanes 1
# FUNC + EDIT alone, OCT- = keep
key b10 down
press EDIT
release EDIT
key b10 up
wait 200
expect autoask 1
shot autodel_ask.png
tap OCT-
wait 200
expect lanes 1
# again, OCT+ = gone
key b10 down
press EDIT
release EDIT
key b10 up
wait 200
expect autoask 1
tap OCT+
wait 200
expect lanes 0
# nothing left: only a warning, no question
key b10 down
press EDIT
release EDIT
key b10 up
wait 200
expect autoask 0
expect lanes 0
